==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**4 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A simple stage including Le'boin, so stacking [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] is the best strategy.

==Trivia==
*Ocha Domain is named after the Japanese word 御茶 ''ocha'' (tea, usually green tea).

